  Sidecar[Sidecar/Proxy]
  LocalCP[Cluster Control Plane]
  GlobalCP[Global Control Plane]
  PKI[Mesh PKI/Trust]
  Registry[Service Registry]
  Telemetry[Telemetry Pipeline]
  Store[(Config Store)]

  Client --> Sidecar
  Sidecar <-->|xDS| LocalCP
  LocalCP <-->|Sync| GlobalCP
  GlobalCP --> Store
  GlobalCP --> Registry
  GlobalCP --> PKI
  Sidecar --> Telemetry
  LocalCP --> PKI
  Telemetry --> Store
```

